      "on": "2026-11-25",
      "words": "Carmine Penta, only Adhesive, 200 Runner from feet to 2-3m border 5 grenades (screenshots)"
    }
  ],
  "notes": "A level 200 Runner, paused in the Simulacrum, and no numbers were predicted to Pavel. The report said level 220; the level doesn't matter here. The numbers were read off the screenshots, one for each row: 350, 350, 330, 614 (yellow), 278; 350, 347, 669 (yellow), 628 (yellow), 286. They are taken to be at 0 to 2 m, in steps of 0.5 m. An explosion counts up to the enemy's body, which is about half a metre out from where the distance is taken to. Placed by eye. Adhesive Blast only makes the grenades stick, so it is left out. Carmine Penta is not in the library yet.",
